  "equipment_type": "Boiler cascade controller gateway",
  "applies_to": "Bosch/Buderus SSB 255, 399 and 512 condensing boilers in a cascade (C_Platform), read through the ProtoAir FPA-W44 gateway.",
  "summary": "Bosch's ProtoAir FPA-W44 start-up guide maps the C_Platform (Buderus SSB 255/399/512 cascade) to 154 objects: unit selection and control register, state, status, error code, pump states, temperatures, firing rate, flame current, ignition and burn-hour counters, 16-deep lockout and blocking history, state/error/firing rate of up to 15 dependent boilers, and read and write copies of the CH/DHW mode, setpoints, reset curve, warm weather shutdown and night setback.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP",
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Appendix C.1 of the guide (pages 56-58). Appendix C.2 (D_Platform, SSB800/1000) is already in the library as bosch/ssb-boiler-protonode.",
    "The guide states 154 points for the C_Platform profile.",
    "The table gives no units, ranges or state texts."
  ],
  "integration": {
    "summary": "Map the CH mode and setpoint AVs for control and read State, Status, supply and return temperatures, firing rate, the error code and the dependent boilers' state. The guide does not explain the Control Register or the mode codes, so check the boiler's Modbus documentation before writing.",
    "minimum_points": [
      {
        "ref": "AV 144",
        "name": "CH Mode",
        "why": "Central heating mode command"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AV 146",
        "name": "CH Setpoint",
        "why": "Central heating setpoint"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AV 2",
        "name": "Control Register",
        "why": "Control register; see the boiler Modbus manual"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 3",
        "name": "State",
        "why": "Boiler state code"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 4",
        "name": "Status",
        "why": "Boiler status code"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 9",
        "name": "Supply Temperature",
        "why": "Supply water temperature"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 15",
        "name": "Firing Rate",
        "why": "Firing rate"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 87",
        "name": "Dependent 01 State",
        "why": "Dependent 01 state (repeat for 02-15)"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 5",
        "name": "Error Code",
        "why": "Active error code"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "AV 144-155 are the writable mode, setpoint, reset-curve and night setback values (their read-back copies are AI 132-143). AV 2 Control Register is writable too; the guide does not say how it is used.",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "ProtoAir FPA-W44 to the boiler: Modbus RTU, 9600 baud; the C_Platform profile is auto-discovered.",
      "BACnet device instance = Node_Offset (default 50,000) + Node-ID; set BACnet Virtual Server Nodes when several devices share the gateway.",
      "Field protocol (BACnet IP, BACnet MS/TP, Modbus TCP or N2) is chosen in the ProtoAir web app."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "Access is inferred from the N2 type (AO = writable); the table has no read/write column.",
      "No units, ranges or code tables are given; temperature units follow AV 1 Unit Selection.",
      "Object AI 17 is not used; one writable object is printed as AV 140 where AV 150 is expected."
    ]
  },
